      "composition": "single-ornament",
      "description": "A square, four-fold symmetrical ornament engraved as solid black shapes. A central medallion holds a rosette among fine leaf scrolls; a broad ring of dense black scrollwork encloses it, drawn out into a pointed lobe on each side, inside a thin ruled square whose spandrels hold four small animals, a long-tailed quadruped and three birds. Outside the square the ornament spreads as open scrollwork with large black flowers, tulip-shaped buds and rows of round berries, ending in sprays at the corners. Black ink on a transparent background; a faint film of paper tone remains over the square.",
